Z||000000||kslish||08-06-2001||01:38 AM||||Well, "technically" she did....twice in fact....not that I was in it too or anything  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <P>Figured the topic title would attract some attention to a thread and I told Jen (Fierochic88) at Williamsburg I was going to post it, and I'm a man of my word   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Anyways, I just got back home from the Williamsburg show a few hours ago....  The trip was fun because of the new people I got to meet (skitime, Formula88, LZeitgeist, and others I can't think of right now) and old friends I got to hang out with (you all know who you are).  <P>I didn't enjoy the heat too much though... but at least it didn't rain....<P>Jen, you gonna post any of those pics you took with your digital camera?  Your parents kick butt also, I think your dad can repair a Fiero in his sleep....hehe.<P>P.S. - Jen, you and you-know-who can crash in my hotel room anytime   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Ken S.||||reg||1
