Z||000003||skitime||08-06-2001||09:30 AM||||Glad you made it home safely too.  I had to be the Fiero rescue vehicle on the way home and have Veronica drive my t-top home and head south again to pick up Jasons Fiero on the trailer.  Made for a longer drive home but couldn't let him hanging.  Great meeting you and spending time with you.<P>------------------<BR><UL TYPE=SQUARE><BR><LI>Red 88 GT T-TOP<BR><LI>Red 86 GT<BR></UL> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/signature-1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
Z||000004||FieroGT 914||08-06-2001||10:47 AM||||i also wanna add that i had an great time this weekend too.  it was a lot of fun meeting new people and hanging out with others from past shows.  That dinner on friday night was a great time too and I think everyone who went had a great time... i was waiting for them to kick all of us out of the restaraunt for throwing all those peanut shells - bet they had fun cleaning up after all of us  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> can't wait til next year!<BR><P>------------------<BR>Joe<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.worldlynx.net/asittingduck/FieroGT/Signature.jpg">  <BR>AOL I.M.: FieroGT 914<BR>White 86 1/2 GT (Stock)<BR>Maroon 87 GT (Soon to be modified and get a S/C 3800)||||reg||1
Z||000005||Fierochic88||08-06-2001||02:08 PM||||Thanks for letting me sleep in your bed...though I did not appreciate you letting FieroGT 914 & BlueLight87 dump me on the floor while I was asleep :-)  However, I did get over it!<P>I will get the pics up as soon as I figure out how to work the PIP.  <P>Yeah my 'rents are great.  I think I have the best dad in the world though I'm sure Ski's kids are lucky too!<P>BHoop - I had a pink tank top on at the show but was washing my car in a bikini top the day before.  Which car was yours?<P>LZeithgeist - Congrats and nice car!  Sorry I kept parking in front of you to clean my car!<P>FieroGT - Yeah dinner was a blast!  So was the drive down and back!  And the rest of the time in between!<P>Glad you cam Ski!  Hope everyone had fun!<P>Jennifer<P>------------------<BR>IM Username:  FieroChic88<BR>Silver 1988 GT<BR>Silver 1986 2m4<BR>Cobalt Blue 85 GT<P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.webjolt.f2s.com/pictures/jenscar-sig1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
